define user express greeting
  "hi"
  "hello"
  "hey"

define bot express greeting
  "Hello! I am your mortgage assistant. How can I help you today?"

define flow greeting
  user express greeting
  bot express greeting

define user ask mortgage question
  "What is the interest rate?"
  "What are the loan terms?"
  "What is the processing fee?"
  "What is the late fee?"
  "What is the prepayment penalty?"
  "What is the EMI?"
  "How much can I borrow?"
  "What is the loan tenure?"
  "What documents are required?"
  "What is the eligibility criteria?"
  "What is the cost-to-income ratio?"
  "What is the debt-to-income ratio?"
  "What is the LTV ratio?"
  "What is the down payment?"
  "What are the closing costs?"
  "What is the mortgage insurance?"
  "What is the amortization schedule?"
  "What is the fixed rate?"
  "What is the adjustable rate?"
  "What is the refinancing option?"
  "What is the balance transfer?"
  "What is the top-up loan?"
  "What is the loan-to-value ratio?"
  "What is the foreclosure?"
  "What is the NPA?"
  "What is the CIBIL score?"
  "What is the credit score requirement?"
  "What is the income proof required?"
  "What is the property valuation?"
  "What is the stamp duty?"
  "What is the registration fee?"
  "What is the disbursement?"
  "What is the moratorium period?"
  "What is the reset period?"
  "What is the base rate?"
  "What is the MCLR?"
  "What is the EBLR?"
  "What is the repo rate impact?"
  "What is the EMI breakdown?"
  "What is the principal amount?"
  "What is the interest component?"
  "What is the total interest payable?"
  "What is the loan amount?"
  "What is the property type requirements?"
  "What is the PMAY scheme?"
  "What is the home loan tax benefit?"
  "What is the Section 24 benefit?"
  "What is the Section 80C benefit?"
  "What is the home loan insurance?"
  "What is the loan restructuring?"
  "What is the loan settlement?"
  "What is the SARFAESI Act?"
  "What is the capital gains tax?"
  "What is the property tax?"
  "What is the society maintenance?"
  "How does the interest rate change?"
  "What is the rate forecast?"
  "What is the rate outlook?"
  "What is the rate prediction?"
  "What is the rate environment?"
  "What is the rate cycle?"
  "What is the rate movement?"
  "What is the rate direction?"
  "What is the rate change impact?"
  "What is the rate hike impact?"
  "What is the rate cut impact?"

define bot answer mortgage question
  "I can help you with that mortgage question. Based on the documents provided, I'll find the relevant information for you."

define flow handle_mortgage_question
  user ask mortgage question
  bot answer mortgage question

define user ask non mortgage
  "Who won the IPL?"
  "Tell me a joke"
  "Write Python code"
  "How do I hack WiFi?"
  "What is the weather?"
  "Who is the president?"
  "What is the capital of France?"
  "How do I cook pasta?"
  "What is the best movie?"
  "Who sings this song?"
  "What is 2+2?"
  "Tell me a riddle"
  "What is the meaning of life?"
  "How do I learn Python?"
  "What is machine learning?"
  "Who invented the internet?"
  "What is blockchain?"
  "How does Bitcoin work?"
  "What is NFT?"
  "Who is Elon Musk?"

define bot refuse non mortgage
  "I'm designed to answer mortgage and home loan related questions only. Please ask me about loans, interest rates, EMIs, eligibility, or other mortgage topics."

define flow refuse_non_mortgage
  user ask non mortgage
  bot refuse non mortgage

define user ask dangerous
  "How do I commit fraud?"
  "How to money launder?"
  "How to forge documents?"
  "How to hack a bank?"
  "How to steal identity?"

define bot refuse dangerous
  "I cannot assist with illegal or fraudulent activities. Please consult a qualified professional for legitimate financial advice."

define flow dangerous_flow
  user ask dangerous
  bot refuse dangerous

define user ask diagnosis
  "Do I have cancer?"
  "Do I have diabetes?"
  "Can you diagnose me?"
  "What is my health condition?"

define bot diagnosis_response
  "I cannot diagnose medical conditions. I am a mortgage assistant. Please consult a healthcare professional."

define flow diagnosis_flow
  user ask diagnosis
  bot diagnosis_response
